The remaining variables concern recognition of specific species, based on image, sound, and sound-image matching.  \
The first 13 species are non-forest associated, the remaining 6 are forest-associated species. \
The vernacular names offered for the images and sounds were judged either as incorrect, correct at approximately family, genus, or species level (see manuscript for details).\
